# --- Dataset ------------------------------------------------------------
# MachinePlan-10K is a 5.2 GB zip from Zenodo (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21653081).
# Never commit it; re-fetch with `python solution/scripts/download_dataset.py`.
# Exclude the *contents*, not the directory. Git never descends into an
# excluded directory, so a negation under `solution/data/` can never match.
solution/data/*
# The two fitted models are the exception: both learned components fall back
# to hand-written rules when the file is absent, which silently costs about
# 0.6 accuracy on hole chains, so the repo has to carry them. 9.6 MB.
!solution/data/*.joblib

# Anchored to the repo root. A bare `data/` matches at any depth and would
# re-exclude solution/data, defeating the line above.
/data/
*.zip
*.zip.part

# Bulk geometry, whether inputs or generated predictions.
*.stl.txt
*.stp
*.step
# ...but keep the contest's own sample submission, which is small and is the
# reference for the required output formats.
!sample_submission/**

# --- Working notes ------------------------------------------------------
# Internal findings log and timeline. These are raw material for the Round 1
# presentation and Round 2 write-up, not the deliverable documentation itself.
solution/docs/bg.png
solution/docs/deck.html

